To get a right angle, I have to go to proposition 11. Proposition 11:

00:23:11.768 --> 00:23:14.520
to draw a straight line at right angles to a given straight line.

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:19.078
Let AB given straight line, and C a given point have been taken at random on it,

00:23:19.078 --> 00:23:20.560
and let CE be made equal.

