Unbelievable, but true.

00:28:16.690 --> 00:28:19.330
Euclid's Elements is not a classic for nothing.

00:28:19.490 --> 00:28:24.850
Euclid is not a symbol of exact reasoning because of some lazy Eurocentric birthright.

00:28:26.130 --> 00:28:29.170
No, Euclid's Elements, it really is that good.

